  "question": {
    "text": "For the reaction \\(14 N+\\alpha \\longrightarrow{}^{17} O+p\\), $1.16 \\mathrm{MeV}($ Mass equivalent $=0.00124 \\mathrm{amu})$ of energy is absorbed. Mass on the reactant side is $18.00567$ amu and proton mass $=1.00782 \\mathrm{amu}$. The atomic mass of ${ }^{17} \\mathrm{O}$ will be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$17.0044 \\mathrm{amu}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$16.9991 \\mathrm{amu}$",
